WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.869
Pocket is gone. Now what?

2
00:00:01.969 --> 00:00:04.527
Save any page with one click, with a summary

3
00:00:04.527 --> 00:00:04.971
on top.

4
00:00:04.971 --> 00:00:07.688
Your library has tags and search, and sends

5
00:00:07.688 --> 00:00:08.488
to your Kindle.

6
00:00:08.488 --> 00:00:11.029
Free, and it all stays on your device.
